<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><!--
   What Android backs up to your Google account (Android 11 and older; newer phones use
   data_extraction_rules.xml, which says the same). Only what's listed here is backed up:
   - the app's settings, notes, timers, WikiSync name and so on (shared preferences)
   - your Inventory Setups pictures
   The game pictures the app downloads (DPS item pictures, puzzle pictures, quest pictures) are left
   out: they're Jagex's artwork, they can be downloaded again, and they'd take the app over Android's
   25 MB backup limit, which would stop everything else being backed up too.
-->
<full-backup-content>
    <include domain="sharedpref" path="." />
    <include domain="file" path="setups/" />
</full-backup-content>
